        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Find quick answers about reservations, check-in, cancellation, payments, and your stay.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
        <div class="border-b border-gray-100">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left px-7 py-6 bg-transparent border-0 cursor-pointer">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#F8F6F1] text-navy flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0">01</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-lg">How can I book a room?</span>
            </span>
            <span class="faq-icon w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F8F6F1] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer px-7" style="max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height 0.4s ease;">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed pb-6 pl-16">Select your preferred room, choose your check-in and check-out dates, enter your guest information, and complete the booking process.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-b border-gray-100">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left px-7 py-6 bg-transparent border-0 cursor-pointer">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#F8F6F1] text-navy flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0">02</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-lg">What time is check-in and check-out?</span>
            </span>
            <span class="faq-icon w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F8F6F1] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer px-7" style="max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height 0.4s ease;">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed pb-6 pl-16">Standard check-in starts at 2:00 PM and check-out is available until 12:00 PM. Early check-in may be available depending on room availability.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-b border-gray-100">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left px-7 py-6 bg-transparent border-0 cursor-pointer">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#F8F6F1] text-navy flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0">03</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-lg">Can I cancel my reservation?</span>
            </span>
            <span class="faq-icon w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F8F6F1] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer px-7" style="max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height 0.4s ease;">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed pb-6 pl-16">Yes. Cancellation policies depend on the selected room and booking plan. Please check the cancellation terms before confirming your reservation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-b border-gray-100">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left px-7 py-6 bg-transparent border-0 cursor-pointer">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#F8F6F1] text-navy flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0">04</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-lg">Is breakfast included?</span>
            </span>
            <span class="faq-icon w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F8F6F1] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer px-7" style="max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height 0.4s ease;">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed pb-6 pl-16">Breakfast is included with selected room categories. You can see whether breakfast is included in the room comparison before booking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-b border-gray-100">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left px-7 py-6 bg-transparent border-0 cursor-pointer">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#F8F6F1] text-navy flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0">05</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-lg">Is online payment secure?</span>
            </span>
            <span class="faq-icon w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F8F6F1] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer px-7" style="max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height 0.4s ease;">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed pb-6 pl-16">Yes. Our booking process is designed to keep your payment information secure and protected with industry-standard encryption.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left px-7 py-6 bg-transparent border-0 cursor-pointer">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#F8F6F1] text-navy flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0">06</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-lg">Do you provide airport transportation?</span>
            </span>
            <span class="faq-icon w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F8F6F1] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer px-7" style="max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height 0.4s ease;">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed pb-6 pl-16">Airport transportation can be arranged through our guest support team. Contact us after making your reservation for available options.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ================= FINAL CTA ================= -->
<section class="pb-20 pt-16 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden relative bg-navy text-white">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30" style="background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566073771259-6a8506099945?w=1400&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
      <div class="relative px-7 md:px-12 py-14 md:py-16">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <div class="text-gold text-xs uppercase tracking-[3px] font-bold mb-4">A Better Stay Awaits</div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold mb-4">Ready to make your stay memorable?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-7">
            Choose your room, complete your booking and get ready for a comfortable HotelReserve experience.
          </p>
          <a href="#rooms" class="btn-gold inline-flex items-center px-7 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold no-underline">
            Browse Rooms <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


